<LegalLayout title="Support — Nestkeep" description="Support and help for the Nestkeep iOS app.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Nestkeep</p>
  <h1>Support</h1>

  <p>Nestkeep helps you run your household: don&rsquo;t forget anything, don&rsquo;t lose anything. It does two things: reminders for the things a home needs, and a private place to keep your receipts and warranties. There is no account and no setup; you add things only when you want to.</p>

  <h2>Common questions</h2>

  <h2>Do I need an account?</h2>
  <p>No. There&rsquo;s no sign-up and no login. Just open the app and start adding what matters.</p>

  <h2>How do reminders work?</h2>
  <p>Add a reminder with a name and how often it repeats, in days, weeks, months, or years. It starts today and repeats until you delete it. You will get a reminder at 9am on the day it is due. Swipe to complete it, and the next one is scheduled automatically, or snooze it for a week.</p>

  <h2>Will it notify me at night?</h2>
  <p>No. Reminders are always delivered at 9am your local time on the due date.</p>

  <h2>How do I keep a receipt or warranty?</h2>
  <p>Open the Storage tab and add an item with a name and notes. You can attach up to 10 photos from your camera or library, search your items by title or notes, and export a photo back to Photos whenever you need it.</p>

  <h2>Where is my data stored?</h2>
  <p>Everything is stored locally on your phone. There is no account and no server, and your data is included in your normal iCloud device backup. See our <a href="/nestkeep/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

  <h2>Need more help?</h2>
  <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:support@mikhailnarbekov.com">support@mikhailnarbekov.com</a>. We aim to reply within a few business days.</p>
</LegalLayout>
